{"tool_name":"3view-import-list","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>The purpose of this plugin is to create a text file with a list of files from&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.gatan.com/products/sem_products/products/3View_landing.php\">Gatan\u2019s 3View</a>&nbsp;montage image stacks. This text file can then be used to automatically import all the images into TrakEM2, as they are, stored in the original directories.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>The purpose of this plugin is to create a text file with a list of files from&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.gatan.com/products/sem_products/products/3View_landing.php\">Gatan\u2019s 3View</a>&nbsp;montage image stacks. This text file can then be used to automatically import all the images into TrakEM2, as they are, stored in the original directories.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-16T18:12:46+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-11T13:08:43+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4497,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"f216975b-bbf3-4489-bfa4-d29978296516","url":"/taxonomy/term/4497"},{"target_id":4498,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"527fe6c8-588c-4021-8380-285432a4956a","url":"/taxonomy/term/4498"},{"target_id":4524,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"69186d59-a42d-4cf8-a9d0-739a41e65f9e","url":"/taxonomy/term/4524"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505206701,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"Fiji wiki: 3View import list","uri":"http://imagej.net/3View_import_list"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":98,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"2ae7ecac-ed23-4375-8a06-79f6a294e65b","url":"/user/98"}],"has